00:00:00.528 --> 00:00:02.820
ALICIA WILLIAMS: Cloud Spanner
is a relational database

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:06.030
that powers billion-user products every month

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.250
It's trusted by
banks, retailers,

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.290
and many other
organizations to support

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.060
their mission-critical
applications.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.720
So how do you know if
Spanner makes sense for you?

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.030
Today, we're highlighting
three industries

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.970
that rely on Spanner to
solve challenges, reduce

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:24.570
costs, and accelerate
innovation to deliver best

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.670
of breed customer experience.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:27.600
Stay tuned.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.855
